# ⭐ SECTION 2 — RENDER DEPLOYMENT (Backend)

Render is the fastest way to deploy your backend.

### 2.1 Create `render.yaml`

Claude will create this file in root:

```yaml
services:
  - type: web
    name: grace-backend
    env: node
    region: oregon
    plan: starter
    buildCommand: "npm install"
    startCommand: "node src/backend/server.js"
    envVars:
      - key: NODE_ENV
        value: production
      - key: MONGO_URI
        sync: false
      - key: FRONTEND_URL
        value: https://grace-frontend.onrender.com
```

