# ⭐ SECTION 6 — GITHUB ACTIONS CI/CD (Backend)

Claude will create `.github/workflows/backend.yml`:

```yaml
name: Backend CI/CD

on:
  push:
    branches: ["main"]

jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - name: Setup Node.js
        uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: "18"

      - run: npm install
      - run: npm test

      - name: Deploy to Render
        run: curl -X POST ${{ secrets.RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK }}
```

